1
00:00:00,024 --> 00:00:01,343
Qu Yuan was a great poet
屈原是一位伟大的诗人

2
00:00:01,344 --> 00:00:03,423
We remember him during the Dragon Boat Festival
端午节的时候我们记得他

3
00:00:03,423 --> 00:00:05,222
People throw zongzi into the river
人们把粽子扔进河里

4
00:00:05,224 --> 00:00:07,395
They do this to honor Qu Yuan
他们这样做是为了纪念屈原

5
00:00:07,543 --> 00:00:09,240
We also have dragon boat races
我们也有龙舟比赛

6
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,635
It is a fun way to remember his bravery
这是纪念他勇敢的有趣方式

7
00:00:11,784 --> 00:00:14,867
I Love learning about Qu Yuan because he was very wise
我喜欢了解屈原因为他很聪明

